description:
Susun output sebelum dan setelah pertukaran nilai. Variabel temp menyimpan nilai first sebelum ditimpa.

```java
public class TraceValueSwap {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int first = 3;
        int second = 8;
        System.out.println("First: " + first);
        System.out.println("Second: " + second);
        int temp = first;
        first = second;
        second = temp;
        System.out.println("First: " + first);
        System.out.println("Second: " + second);
    }
}
```
